---
import {productReference} from '../data/product-reference';
const {manifest, database} = productReference;
const tables = database.databases.flatMap(db => db.tables.map(table => ({db, table})));
const contexts = [...new Set(tables.map(({table}) => table.context))].sort();
const totalFields = tables.reduce((sum, {table}) => sum + table.columns.length, 0);
const tableId = (db: string, schema: string, name: string) => `table-${db}-${schema}-${name}`;
const fieldId = (db: string, schema: string, name: string, column: string) => `field-${db}-${schema}-${name}-${column}`;
const example = (value: unknown) => typeof value === 'string' ? value : JSON.stringify(value, null, 2);
---
<p><strong>{tables.length} tablas · {totalFields} campos</strong> · PostgreSQL · Revisión <a href={`${manifest.source.repository}/commit/${manifest.source.commit}`}>{manifest.source.commit.slice(0, 12)}</a></p>
<div class="dictionary" data-dictionary>
  <form class="dictionary-search" role="search" aria-label="Diccionario de datos">
    <label for="dictionary-query">Buscar tabla, campo o descripción</label>
    <div class="search-row"><input id="dictionary-query" type="search" placeholder="Ej. sales.sale, outbox o moneda" autocomplete="off" /><button type="reset">Limpiar</button></div>
    <p class="search-count" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-dictionary-count>{tables.length} tablas · {totalFields} campos</p>
  </form>
  <nav aria-label="Contextos de datos" class="context-links">{contexts.map(context => <a href={`#context-${context}`}>{context}</a>)}</nav>
  <details class="dictionary-method"><summary>Origen, ejemplos y descargas</summary>
    <p>La estructura procede de migraciones aplicadas a PostgreSQL de pruebas; las descripciones se mantienen junto al código del contexto propietario en POS Platform. Esta referencia describe implementación, no una base productiva. El <a href="/guide/diagrams/">mapa de arquitectura</a> muestra la autoridad de cada almacén; las fichas del roadmap identifican los datos todavía propuestos.</p>
    <p>Los ejemplos son valores sintéticos por campo, no filas listas para insertar. Se verifica su compatibilidad con el tipo SQL; no prueban relaciones entre filas, reglas de negocio o aceptación fiscal. Las credenciales se omiten.</p>
    <p><a href="/contracts/database/schema.json" download>Descargar diccionario JSON</a> · <a href="/contracts/manifest.json">Revisión y hashes</a> · <a href="/guide/api/pos-platform/">Contratos HTTP</a></p>
  </details>
  <p data-dictionary-empty hidden>No hay tablas ni campos con esa búsqueda.</p>
  {contexts.map(context => <section data-data-context>
    <h2 id={`context-${context}`}>{context}</h2>
    <p>{database.databases.filter(db => db.tables.some(table => table.context === context)).map((db, index) => <>{index > 0 && ' · '}<a href={`/explore/data-${db.id}-${context}/`}>Explorar relaciones · {db.id === 'branch' ? 'sucursal' : 'país'}</a></>)}</p>
    {tables.filter(({table}) => table.context === context).map(({db, table}) => (
      <details class="data-table" id={tableId(db.id, table.schema, table.name)} data-data-table data-table-search={`${db.id} ${db.app} ${table.context} ${table.schema}.${table.name} ${table.documentation.description} ${table.documentation.usage}`}>
        <summary><code>{table.schema}.{table.name}</code><span class="table-count">{table.columns.length} campos · {db.id === 'branch' ? 'sucursal' : 'país'}</span><span class="table-purpose">{table.documentation.description}</span></summary>
        <div class="data-detail">
          <p>{table.documentation.usage}</p>
          <p class="data-meta">Aplicación: <code>{db.app}</code> · Contexto propietario: <code>{table.context}</code> · <a href={`#${tableId(db.id, table.schema, table.name)}`}>Enlace a esta tabla</a></p>
          <h3>Campos</h3>
          <div class="data-fields">{table.columns.map(column => <details class="data-field" id={fieldId(db.id, table.schema, table.name, column.name)} data-data-field data-field-search={`${table.schema}.${table.name}.${column.name} ${column.type} ${column.documentation.description} ${column.documentation.usage}`}>
            <summary><code>{column.name}</code><span class="field-type">{column.type}{column.nullable ? ' · admite NULL' : ' · requerido'}</span><span class="field-description">{column.documentation.description}</span></summary>
            <div class="field-detail">
              <p><strong>Uso.</strong> {column.documentation.usage}</p>
              <p><strong>Valor predeterminado SQL.</strong> <code>{column.default ?? 'Sin valor predeterminado'}</code></p>
              {column.comment && <p><strong>Comentario SQL.</strong> {column.comment}</p>}
              {Object.hasOwn(column.documentation, 'example') ? <><p><strong>Ejemplo sintético del campo</strong></p><pre tabindex="0" aria-label={`Ejemplo de ${table.schema}.${table.name}.${column.name}`}><code>{example(column.documentation.example)}</code></pre></> : <p><strong>Ejemplo omitido.</strong> {column.documentation.exampleOmittedReason}</p>}
              <a href={`#${fieldId(db.id, table.schema, table.name, column.name)}`}>Enlace a este campo</a>
            </div>
          </details>)}</div>
          <details class="sql-details"><summary>Claves, restricciones e índices</summary>
            <p>Las claves y restricciones declaradas se extraen de PostgreSQL. Los triggers y las validaciones de aplicación se consultan en las fuentes de la tabla.</p>
            <h4>Restricciones</h4><ul>{table.constraints.map(constraint => <li><code>{constraint.name}</code>: <code>{constraint.definition}</code></li>)}</ul>
            <h4>Índices</h4><ul>{table.indexes.map(index => <li><code>{index.definition}</code></li>)}</ul>
          </details>
          <details class="sources"><summary>Fuentes de esta definición</summary><ul>{table.documentation.sources.map(source => <li><a href={`${manifest.source.repository}/blob/${manifest.source.commit}/${source.path}`}>{source.path}</a>{source.symbol && <> · <code>{source.symbol}</code></>}</li>)}</ul></details>
        </div>
      </details>
    ))}
  </section>)}
</div>
<details><summary>Migraciones aplicadas</summary><pre tabindex="0"><code>{JSON.stringify(database.databases.map(db => ({database: db.id, migrations: db.migrations})), null, 2)}</code></pre></details>

<script>
  const root = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-dictionary]');
  if (root) {
    const form = root.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('form')!;
    const input = root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('input')!;
    const count = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-dictionary-count]')!;
    const empty = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-dictionary-empty]')!;
    const tables = [...root.querySelectorAll<HTMLDetailsElement>('[data-data-table]')];
    const normalize = (value: string) => value.normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g, '').toLocaleLowerCase('es');
    const index = tables.map(table => ({table, text: normalize(table.dataset.tableSearch!), fields: [...table.querySelectorAll<HTMLDetailsElement>('[data-data-field]')].map(field => ({field, text: normalize(field.dataset.fieldSearch!)}))}));
    const filter = () => {
      const words = normalize(input.value.trim()).split(/\s+/).filter(Boolean);
      const matches = (text: string) => words.every(word => text.includes(word));
      let visibleTables = 0, visibleFields = 0;
      for (const {table, text, fields} of index) {
        const whole = matches(text);
        let fieldsVisible = 0;
        for (const {field, text: fieldText} of fields) {
          field.hidden = !(whole || matches(`${text} ${fieldText}`));
          if (!field.hidden) fieldsVisible++;
        }
        table.hidden = fieldsVisible === 0 && !whole;
        if (!table.hidden) { visibleTables++; visibleFields += fieldsVisible; }
        if (words.length) table.open = !table.hidden;
      }
      for (const section of root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-data-context]')) section.hidden = ![...section.querySelectorAll<HTMLDetailsElement>('[data-data-table]')].some(table => !table.hidden);
      count.textContent = `${visibleTables} tablas · ${visibleFields} campos`;
      empty.hidden = visibleTables !== 0;
    };
    const revealTarget = () => {
      let id: string;
      try { id = decodeURIComponent(location.hash.slice(1)); } catch { return; }
      const target = document.getElementById(id);
      if (!target || !root.contains(target)) return;
      input.value = ''; filter();
      if (target instanceof HTMLDetailsElement) target.open = true;
      const parent = target.closest<HTMLDetailsElement>('[data-data-table]');
      if (parent) parent.open = true;
      requestAnimationFrame(() => target.scrollIntoView({block:'start', behavior:'instant'}));
    };
    form.addEventListener('submit', event => event.preventDefault());
    form.addEventListener('reset', () => { input.value = ''; filter(); input.focus(); });
    input.addEventListener('input', filter);
    window.addEventListener('hashchange', revealTarget);
    revealTarget();
  }
</script>

<style>
  .dictionary { min-width:0; }
  .dictionary [hidden] { display:none !important; }
  .dictionary-search { margin-block:1.5rem; }
  label { display:block; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:.4rem; }
  .search-row { display:flex; gap:.5rem; }
  input { flex:1; min-width:0; width:100%; font:inherit; padding:.65rem .75rem; color:var(--sl-color-text); background:var(--sl-color-bg); border:1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-3); border-radius:.35rem; }
  button { font:inherit; font-weight:600; color:var(--sl-color-text-accent); background:var(--sl-color-bg); border:1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-4); border-radius:.35rem; padding:.5rem .75rem; cursor:pointer; }
  .search-count { font-size:.875rem; color:var(--sl-color-gray-2); margin-top:.4rem; }
  .context-links { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.4rem 1rem; padding-block:.5rem 1rem; }
  .dictionary-method { margin-block:.5rem 1.5rem; }
  .dictionary-method summary { padding:.35rem 0; font-size:.9rem; }
  .data-table { margin-block:.75rem; border:1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius:.5rem; scroll-margin-top:6rem; }
  summary { padding:.85rem; cursor:pointer; font-weight:600; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
  :is(summary,input,button,pre):focus-visible { outline:2px solid var(--sl-color-accent); outline-offset:2px; }
  .table-count { display:inline-block; margin-left:.75rem; font-weight:400; font-size:.8rem; color:var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  .table-purpose { display:block; font-weight:400; font-size:.9rem; margin-top:.3rem; }
  .data-detail { padding:0 1rem 1rem; min-width:0; }
  .data-meta { font-size:.85rem; }
  .data-fields { border-block:1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); }
  .data-field { margin:0; scroll-margin-top:6rem; }
  .data-field + .data-field { border-top:1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); }
  .data-field summary { padding:.75rem .25rem; }
  .field-type { font-size:.8rem; font-weight:400; margin-left:.5rem; color:var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  .field-description { display:block; font-size:.9rem; font-weight:400; margin-top:.3rem; }
  .field-detail { padding:0 .25rem 1rem; min-width:0; }
  .field-detail p { margin-block:.6rem; }
  .field-detail a { font-size:.85rem; }
  .data-field:target { background:var(--sl-color-bg-inline-code); }
  .sql-details, .sources { margin-top:1rem; }
  .sql-details summary, .sources summary { padding:.5rem 0; }
  pre { overflow:auto; max-height:24rem; max-width:100%; padding:.85rem; border:1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); font-size:.8rem; }
  li, p, code { overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
  pre code { overflow-wrap:normal; }
  @media(max-width:40rem) { .data-detail { padding-inline:.65rem; } .table-count { display:block; margin:.35rem 0 0; } .field-type { display:block; margin:.3rem 0 0; } }
</style>
